data: {"id": "0a44f11ae754428c-thinking-parallel_evidence-2143", "run_id": "0a44f11ae754428c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 调查证据总结\n\n### Pod 身份与拓扑\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r`，UID `f0496f24-4504-47ae-8b6d-685bd1536991`\n- **当前状态**: Running（从 03:55:03 起），节点 node2\n- **所属**: Deployment `workload` → ReplicaSet `workload-79d9f8fd88`\n- **容器**: `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n- **Service**: `workload` (ad5efe57) 选择此 Pod\n- **QoS**: Burstable（Limits: CPU 200m / Mem 96Mi；Requests: CPU 20m / Mem 24Mi）\n- **重启次数**: 30 次\n\n### 已采集事实（支持/反驳）\n\n#### 支持当前异常的证据：\n1. **Liveness Probe ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 8, "ts_ms": 1789358179194, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

