的精确内存峰值。虽然内存在增长，但无法证明是否真的物理触发了 96Mi 的硬限制，还是因为应用逻辑缺陷导致线程阻塞从而引发 Probe 500 并被系统 Kill。\n3.  **未验证的泄漏假设**：当前证据不足以证明存在持续性的内存泄漏（Memory Leak），因为样本窗口可能仅覆盖了一次异常事件。\n\n综上，根因暂时定性为 **“疑似因资源限制（96Mi）不足或应用层内存泄漏导致的 OOM，进而引发 Liveness 探针失败与进程终止”**，但因缺乏 OOM 判定所需的 Kernel 日志或峰值数据，正式 RCA 判定为证据不足。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 8.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 444.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r: 444.3s (Evidence 428.5s, RCA 15.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r**: pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 479.581, "metrics": {"run_id": "0a44f11ae754428c", "mttr": {"value": "8.0m", "seconds": 479.58802103996277, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 479588.02103996277, "llm_calls": 23, "llm_duration_ms": 159507.50494003296, "tool_calls": 30, "executed_tool_calls": 24, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 5, "successful_tool_calls": 24, "failed_tool_calls": 6, "tool_duration_ms": 665746.110200882, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 319400.89988708496}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 21235.74995994568, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 444322.0136165619, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 14008.414506912231, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

